    thinking: "**Listing Image Paths**\n\nI\'ve successfully generated four high-quality images and am now cataloging them. I\'m focusing on listing the precise file paths for easy access and integration. These include portraits and neural core visuals, preparing for further processing steps. The paths are ready for use.\n\n\n**Cataloging Assets and Tasks**\n\nI am now organizing assets; specifically the image at `deep_cityscape_1791628961314.jpg` and the schematic at `/src/assets/images/ideate_blueprint_schematic_1791628974137.jpg`. I\'ve begun outlining the project structure, with a clear separation of tasks, as requested, including the cyborg-themed landing page. I\'ve broken down the requirements for Task 1, including the top bar, hero section, and related components. This will allow for easier modular updates.\n\n\n**Defining Component Structures**\n\nI\'m solidifying the specifications for the \"Reel\" feature with key attributes like the Titanium Exo-frame and Sub-millisecond Neural Synapse. I\'m also cataloging the Biomechanical Augmentation Systems, including the Bento Grid with its Optical Array, and Synthetic Myofiber Actuators. I am documenting the Interactive Unit Customizer, including finishes, and status. I\'m focusing on the Testimonial section and call to action. I plan to separate a Task 1 source export. Finally, I am ready to construct Task 2, powered by Three.js!\n\n\n**Implementing 3D Interactivity**\n\nI\'m deep in the implementation of real-time 3D controls. This includes comprehensive mouse and touch interactions for orbiting, rotating, zooming, and panning. I\'ve integrated toggleable exploded views and wireframe modes, along with a range of lighting presets and material finish options for components. The component inspector is functional; users can click to focus on specific parts and view real-time 3D coordinates. I\'m also including auto-rotate capabilities and a WebGL context handling. A floating HUD with camera reset and capture is now ready. I am dividing the code to prepare the Task 2 demo video and submission.\n\n\n**Constructing Narrative Sequence**\n\nI\'m now building a deep starfield and nebula canvas with several parallax layers, ranging from a distant cyberpunk skyline to foreground structural elements. A scroll-triggered narrative through five stages is taking form. I am integrating interactive parallax effects and a carousel feature. I\'ll include a code view for the Task 3 submission. I\'ve begun working on Task 4, the landing page.\n\n\n**Designing Interactive Studio**\n\nI\'m developing a futuristic \"Ideate Landing Page\" that will act as a Cybernetic Innovation & Concept Laboratory. The core will be an \"Interactive Concept Generator and Blueprint Canvas\" to allow ideation of next-gen cyborg components. I will include interactive hotspot pins on the generated technical blueprint schematic and a \"Concept Ideator.\" Users will select a domain and adjust parameters, generating technical specs. I am also working on a Modular Feature Matrix and Design System.\n\n\n"
