  planner_response {
    response: "A cybernetic frontend application built with **HTML5, CSS, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS**, structured into **four modular task divisions** with standalone code files, interactive demo modes, and video recording guides.\n\n---\n\n### Task Breakdown & Code Division\n\n| Task | Module Path | Core Technologies & Features |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Task 1: Cyborg Themed Landing Page** | `src/tasks/Task1CyborgLanding/` | \342\200\242 Custom cybernetic typography and responsive Tailwind layout<br>\342\200\242 High-resolution biomechanical visual assets<br>\342\200\242 Subsystems Bento grid (Quantum Core, Titanium Monocoque, Myofiber Actuation)<br>\342\200\242 Interactive Chassis Configurator (4 alloy finishes, 3 sensor spectrums)<br>\342\200\242 Telemetry gauges (0.18ms latency, 99.98% bio-integration) & reservation modal |\n| **Task 2: Build in 3D** | `src/tasks/Task2BuildIn3D/` | \342\200\242 Interactive Three.js WebGL canvas with mouse orbit, drag, and scroll zoom<br>\342\200\242 Interactive **Exploded View Slider (0%\342\200\223100%)** that disassembles components along 3D axes<br>\342\200\242 4 PBR Metallurgy finishes (Titanium, Obsidian, Gold, Cyan)<br>\342\200\242 Wireframe CAD toggle, camera angle presets (Isometric, Front, Top, Core), and snapshot exporter |\n| **Task 3: Interactive Parallax Scrolling** | `src/tasks/Task3ParallaxScroll/` | \342\200\242 Multi-depth optical parallax engine (Starfield nebula, megacity silhouette, holographic transit, foreground struts)<br>\342\200\242 Real-time mouse gyroscopic tilt providing 3D depth even when static<br>\342\200\242 Elevation HUD (0m to 8,000m) and parallax speed ratio selector (0.5x, 1.0x, 1.8x)<br>\342\200\242 5-chapter evolutionary narrative with side jump rail |\n| **Task 4: Ideate Landing Page** | `src/tasks/Task4IdeateLanding/` | \342\200\242 Interactive CAD Blueprint Workbench with **clickable hotspot pins** showing sub-assembly specs<br>\342\200\242 Parametric Concept Ideator (Power efficiency, peak torque, and latency sliders synthesizing BOM & feasibility scores)<br>\342\200\242 Architecture Lifecycle Matrix (Concept vs. Alpha vs. Production)<br>\342\200\242 Collaborative community proposal registry with live voting |\n\n---\n\n### Features for Demo Video Recording & Submission\n\n1. **Presentation Mode**: Click **\"Presentation Mode\"** in the top navigation bar to hide all global header bars, allowing you to record distraction-free demo videos of each individual task.\n2. **Task Code Inspector**: Click **\"Task Code\"** on any task to open the standalone code viewer, copy clean code for that task, and view a timed **Demo Video Recording Script** for that submission.\n3. **Showcase Hub**: Switch to the **Overview Hub** to display all four tasks side by side with feature checklists and launchers."
    thinking: "**Verifying Build Success**\n\nI\'m pleased to report that the initial TypeScript compilation passed without any errors using `tsc --noEmit`. Now, I\'m meticulously reviewing the user\'s requirements to ensure complete alignment, particularly focusing on the frontend tech stack: HTML, CSS, JavaScript, and Tailwind CSS for responsive design. The goal is a cyborg-themed landing page.\n\n\n**Constructing Project Breakdown**\n\nI\'ve just finalized the detailed breakdown into tasks. I will be sure to build the components separately for all the tasks given. Task 1 will be a Cyborg-themed landing page. Task 2 focuses on a real-time Three.js 3D Mech Constructor. I\'ll make sure to get all the components ready and render them as part of the demo videos.\n\n\n**Defining Interactive Features**\n\nMy current focus is on defining interactive features for the 3D Mech Constructor and Parallax Scroll components. I\'m exploring smooth damping for zoom/pan controls and considering an exploded view slider. I\'m also thinking through PBR material switchers and holographic wireframe toggles. Moreover, I\'m setting up subsystem assembly toggles, camera presets, and a 3D blueprint snapshot exporter. Task 3 is shaping up with a multi-layer parallax scrolling engine, depth field with live HUD indicator, and a narrative structure.\n\n\n**Reviewing Task Components**\n\nI\'m now diving deep into Task 3\'s code division and video script, making sure everything is clear and concise. Furthermore, I\'ve outlined Task 4\'s \"Cybernetic Innovation Laboratory\" ideation page, including interactive blueprints, a parametric engine, and an open proposal registry. I\'m also planning the \"Showcase Hub\" with preview cards and a \"Demo Video Submission Assistant\" guide, and a dedicated Task Code Viewer Modal.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "A cybernetic frontend application built with **HTML5, CSS, TypeScript, and Tailwind CSS**, structured into **four modular task divisions** with standalone code files, interactive demo modes, and video recording guides.\n\n---\n\n### Task Breakdown & Code Division\n\n| Task | Module Path | Core Technologies & Features |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Task 1: Cyborg Themed Landing Page** | `src/tasks/Task1CyborgLanding/` | \342\200\242 Custom cybernetic typography and responsive Tailwind layout<br>\342\200\242 High-resolution biomechanical visual assets<br>\342\200\242 Subsystems Bento grid (Quantum Core, Titanium Monocoque, Myofiber Actuation)<br>\342\200\242 Interactive Chassis Configurator (4 alloy finishes, 3 sensor spectrums)<br>\342\200\242 Telemetry gauges (0.18ms latency, 99.98% bio-integration) & reservation modal |\n| **Task 2: Build in 3D** | `src/tasks/Task2BuildIn3D/` | \342\200\242 Interactive Three.js WebGL canvas with mouse orbit, drag, and scroll zoom<br>\342\200\242 Interactive **Exploded View Slider (0%\342\200\223100%)** that disassembles components along 3D axes<br>\342\200\242 4 PBR Metallurgy finishes (Titanium, Obsidian, Gold, Cyan)<br>\342\200\242 Wireframe CAD toggle, camera angle presets (Isometric, Front, Top, Core), and snapshot exporter |\n| **Task 3: Interactive Parallax Scrolling** | `src/tasks/Task3ParallaxScroll/` | \342\200\242 Multi-depth optical parallax engine (Starfield nebula, megacity silhouette, holographic transit, foreground struts)<br>\342\200\242 Real-time mouse gyroscopic tilt providing 3D depth even when static<br>\342\200\242 Elevation HUD (0m to 8,000m) and parallax speed ratio selector (0.5x, 1.0x, 1.8x)<br>\342\200\242 5-chapter evolutionary narrative with side jump rail |\n| **Task 4: Ideate Landing Page** | `src/tasks/Task4IdeateLanding/` | \342\200\242 Interactive CAD Blueprint Workbench with **clickable hotspot pins** showing sub-assembly specs<br>\342\200\242 Parametric Concept Ideator (Power efficiency, peak torque, and latency sliders synthesizing BOM & feasibility scores)<br>\342\200\242 Architecture Lifecycle Matrix (Concept vs. Alpha vs. Production)<br>\342\200\242 Collaborative community proposal registry with live voting |\n\n---\n\n### Features for Demo Video Recording & Submission\n\n1. **Presentation Mode**: Click **\"Presentation Mode\"** in the top navigation bar to hide all global header bars, allowing you to record distraction-free demo videos of each individual task.\n2. **Task Code Inspector**: Click **\"Task Code\"** on any task to open the standalone code viewer, copy clean code for that task, and view a timed **Demo Video Recording Script** for that submission.\n3. **Showcase Hub**: Switch to the **Overview Hub** to display all four tasks side by side with feature checklists and launchers."
